WEBVTT

00:02:28.496 --> 00:02:32.038
sluggish ways that sucked
the joy out of work.

00:02:34.079 --> 00:02:35.954
And I have to tell you,

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:39.204
the future of work
is not going to be created

00:02:39.246 --> 00:02:43.204
with top-down, opinion-driven edicts

00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:46.371
from senior leaders
whose day-to-day realities

00:02:46.413 --> 00:02:53.038
don't match those of us dual-career,
time-pressed and income-pressed people.

00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:55.371
Of course, senior leaders want to go back.

00:02:55.413 --> 00:02:56.704
That worked for them.

00:02:57.496 --> 00:03:01.704
But they have to recognize
that for 18 months now,